        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Stop analyzing another device&apos;s Bluetooth connection. The operation is stopped when this command returns, and the stack does not send additional event.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">analyzer</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>The handle of the connection analyzer to stop</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>SL_STATUS_OK if successful. Error code otherwise. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
        </detaileddescription>
