    <briefdescription>
<para>Connection Analyzer. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Analyze Bluetooth packets that are transmitted on the connections of external devices. Include component bluetooth_feature_connection_analyzer to use the commands and events in this class. </para>
